        "text": "104"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "118"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "128"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Express the top number",
        "body": "Label the bottom layer $a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i$ (rows). The top number is $50+(b+d+f+h)+3e$. To maximise, make $e$ largest, so the other eight are the smallest $1,\\dots,8$ and $e=50-36=14$. Then $b,d,f,h$ should be $5,6,7,8$, sum 26. Top $=50+26+42=118$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 118**"
      }
    ],
